OL,3,GNEWSA'Thieves drilled into my Lexus to
OL,4,Asteal it'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt took about 40 minutes for thieves to
OL,7,Fsteal Dave Whiting's Lexus RX from
OL,8,Foutside his home last August.
OL,10,FAs the 79-year-old slept upstairs, two
OL,11,Fmen used a drill and jigsaw to cut into
OL,12,Fthe vehicle, before driving it away.
OL,14,FHis experience comes as Home Office
OL,15,Fdata shows the West Midlands had the
OL,16,Fhighest rate of vehicle theft offences
OL,17,Fin England and Wales in 2025-26.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
