OL,3,GNEWSA'Thieves drilled into my Lexus to
OL,4,Asteal it'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhiting, from Solihull, said his first
OL,7,Freaction on seeing CCTV of the theft
OL,8,Fwas rage: "They knew what they were
OL,9,Fdoing. They very casually walked down
OL,10,Fthe road, one of them with a drill.
OL,11,FStraight onto the drive."
